Follow root `AGENTS.md`. Load `skills/cypress-to-playwright-migration` when editing Cypress specs or converting them. Load `skills/playwright-testing` when editing `playwright/**`. After a completed change, follow `skills/code-review` instead of self-reviewing the same diff.

Locator order: getByRole > getByLabel > getByPlaceholder > getByText > getByTestId > locator(). Await every action. No waitForTimeout. No cy.* in playwright/.
